      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5179,
      "text": "It is He Who has sent among the unlettered [Arabs] a messenger from among themselves, reciting to them His verses and purifying them, and teaching them the Book and Wisdom [i.e., Sunnah], although before that they were clearly misguided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 62,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجُمُعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jumu'a",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Friday",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 553,
      "ruku": 486,
      "hizbQuarter": 221,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5180,
      "text": "And [he is also sent] to others of them who have not yet joined them, and He is the All-Mighty, the All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 62,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجُمُعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jumu'a",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Friday",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 553,
      "ruku": 486,
      "hizbQuarter": 221,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5181,
      "text": "That is the bounty of Allah that He gives to whom He wills, for Allah is the Lord of great bounty.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 62,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجُمُعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jumu'a",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Friday",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 553,
      "ruku": 486,
      "hizbQuarter": 221,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5182,
      "text": "The similitude of those who were given the Torah but failed to uphold it[1], is like that of a donkey laden with books[2]. How terrible is the similitude of those who reject the verses of Allah! And Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 62,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجُمُعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jumu'a",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Friday",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 553,
      "ruku": 486,
      "hizbQuarter": 221,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5183,
      "text": "Say, “O you who are Jews, if you claim that you alone are Allah’s allies apart from all other people, then wish for death, if you are truthful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 62,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجُمُعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jumu'a",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Friday",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 553,
      "ruku": 486,
      "hizbQuarter": 221,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5184,
      "text": "But they will never wish for it because of what their hands have sent forth[3]. And Allah is All-Knowing of the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 62,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجُمُعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jumu'a",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Friday",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 553,
      "ruku": 486,
      "hizbQuarter": 221,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5185,
      "text": "Say, “The death from which you run away will surely overcome you, then you will be brought back to the Knower of the unseen and the seen, and He will inform you of what you used to do.”",
      "surah": {
